<view class="page random-page"><view class="random-top">🎲<view>今天吃什么？</view><text>让闪电帮你抽一道！</text></view><view wx:if="{{picked}}" class="draw-card cream-card"><image src="{{picked.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="pill">第 {{rolls}} 次心动推荐</view><view class="picked-name">{{picked.name}}</view><view class="muted">{{picked.description}}</view><view class="picked-meta">⏱ {{picked.minutes}} 分钟　⭐ {{picked.difficulty}} 星难度</view><view class="random-actions"><button class="btn btn-light" bindtap="draw">再抽一次</button><button class="btn" bindtap="add">点这道 +</button></view><view class="open" bindtap="open">查看菜品详情 →</view></view><view wx:else class="empty">今天暂时没有可供应的菜品</view><view class="foot">只从当前供应的普通菜品里抽取 💛</view></view>
